mlx-vlm - https://github.com/Blaizzy/mlx-vlm

gmlx carries mlx-vlm 0.7.3 whole under gmlx/_vendor/mlx_vlm, with only
its imports rewritten and a few marked edits (gmlx/_vendor/manifest.json
lists every file). The modules below carry further code copied or ported
from it, with modifications:

- gmlx/models/qwen35/language.py, gated_delta.py, config.py,
  moe_language.py and moe_config.py: the qwen3_5 and qwen3_5_moe text
  models of mlx-vlm 0.6.15 (mlx_vlm/models/qwen3_5/language.py,
  gated_delta.py, config.py and mlx_vlm/models/qwen3_5_moe/language.py,
  config.py). Each file lists its edits in its docstring: absolute
  imports, the text configs only, a gmlx cache class in make_cache, evals
  under an except routed through gmlx.eval_guard, ASCII comments, a
  video-grid bug fix from mlx-vlm 0.7.3, and mlx-lm's SwitchGLU in the
  MoE block.
- gmlx/cache/kv_cache.py: all of mlx_vlm/models/cache.py of mlx-vlm 0.7.3,
  the KV cache classes and their module helpers. gmlx binds them under the
  stock names (gmlx/cache/bind.py) and changes them in place; each change
  carries a comment where it sits.
- gmlx/cache/attention.py: the mask and SDPA helpers of
  mlx_vlm/models/base.py of mlx-vlm 0.7.3 (create_attention_mask,
  create_ssm_mask, align_attention_mask_to_scores,
  quantized_scaled_dot_product_attention, _turboquant_attention_applies
  and scaled_dot_product_attention), with gmlx's routes added.
- gmlx/cache/apc_manager.py: the store_kv_blocks override is a copy of
  mlx_vlm.apc.APCManager.store_kv_blocks with the per-block mx.eval
  hoisted into chunked batches and gmlx's checkpoint-store policy added.
- gmlx/gen/thinking_budget.py: ported from mlx-vlm's ThinkingBudgetCriteria
  stopping-criteria callback, reworked as an mlx-lm logits processor.
- gmlx/systemone/denoise.py: entropy_transfer_mask follows
  mlx_vlm.generate.diffusion._diffusion_entropy_transfer_mask.

